<title>SOUTH AFRICA:  CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 64-2 AT LUNCH VS S.AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 64-2 AT LUNCH VS S.AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 64 for two at lunch on the first day of the third and final test against South Africa at Centurion Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Score: Australia 64-2 against South Africa.</p>
</text>
